---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+18435550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(843) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Poor Airflow from Vents | Charleston SC" description="Weak airflow from vents? Restricted ducts may be the cause. Air duct cleaning in Charleston, SC.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Poor Airflow</h1>
      <p>Debris buildup can restrict air delivery to rooms.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>When ducts are heavily loaded with dust or debris, airflow to individual rooms can drop. Cleaning restores the open path so conditioned air reaches where it should.</p>
      <h2>How Cleaning Helps</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Clears restrictions in trunk and branch lines</li>
        <li>Improves balance when some rooms were underperforming</li>
        <li>Reduces strain on the blower motor</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
